### 作者、理论研究与验证身份 / Attribution and verification identity

中文：作者身份、理论贡献、科研成果与独立技术验证需要分别判断；ORCID、开源参与或软件 DOI 不意味着 Agent 理论已在自治 Runtime 中部署或经外部机构认证

English: Authorship, theoretical contributions, scientific outcomes and independent technical verification require separate assessment. ORCID, open-source participation or software DOI does not imply a deployed agent runtime or external certification

